  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delegation of Rights to Financial Planning to the Embassy in Belgrade. They shall be able to plan, procure and implement minor interventions on behalf of Sida Stockholm with regard to preparatory and analytical work in relation to Sida&apos;s activities in S/M and where the Embassy&apos;s own resources are not sufficient.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Delegering av planeringsutrymme f&#xF6;r mindre insatser i S/M till ambassaden i Belgrad. De skall kunna planera, upphandla och  implementera mindre insater, relaterade till f&#xF6;rberedande och analytiskt arbete kring Sidas aktiviteter i S/M och d&#xE4;r Sidas/ambassadens egna resurser inte r&#xE4;cker till.</narrative>
  </description>
